webtessera is a TypeScript port of Tessera and of the Go libraries Tessera is built
on. It contains translations of their source code and uses their test material. The
attributions below are required by those projects' licences; the per-file headers in
src/ retain the original copyright lines and are authoritative for individual files.

The texts of the third-party licences that are not Apache-2.0 are reproduced verbatim
under LICENSES/.

